ffplay: Phoenix-RTOS video overlay (opt-in: video-play VIDEO_PLANE=1)

A picture of hevc_rpivid's drm_prime output (AV_PIX_FMT_DRM_PRIME) goes to a display
overlay of rpi4-kms at the moment ffplay presents it (rpivid/drm/rpivid_plane.c): no
texture upload, no colour conversion, ffplay's pacing, audio sync, pause and seek
unchanged. A picture the overlay refuses is converted to yuv420p on the CPU and shown the
usual way. Without drm_prime output nothing changes.

LGPL-2.1-or-later, as fftools/ffplay.c.

--- a/fftools/ffplay.c
+++ b/fftools/ffplay.c
